{"id": "22-2367-2-2", "zh": "不省略格尾的依主释（aluttatappurisa）", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-2368-2-6", "zh": "现在讲不省略格尾的依主释。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-2369-2-79", "zh": "Dīpaṅkaro、pabhaṅkaro、amatandado、purindado、vessantaro、attantapo、parantapo、raṇañjaho、jutindharo、vijjandharo、dassanenapahātabbadhammo、kutojo、tatojo、itojo、bhayato upaṭṭhānaṃ（成）bhayatupaṭṭhānaṃ、kaṭattākammaṃ、kaṭattārūpaṃ、parassapadaṃ、attanopadaṃ、devānamindo、devānaṃpiyatisso、gavampatitthero、pubbenivāso、majjhekalyāṇaṃ、dūrerūpaṃ、santikerūpaṃ、dūrenidānaṃ、santikenidānaṃ、antevāsiko、janesuto、kāmesumicchācāro，等等［ka.327；rū.351；nī.686］。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-2370-2-4", "zh": "以上是不省略格尾的依主释。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-2371-2-8", "zh": "所有这些以第二格等为前分的依主释，其数随所指的对象而定，其性则随后分词。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-2372-2-4", "zh": "以第二格等为前分的依主释讲完了。", "confidence": 75}
